{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfpfzUbF8D9uiW11eryRE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Discount Approval Decision: DR-9002\n\nI will follow the Sales Discount SOP to decide this request.\n\n## Analysis\n\n**Step 1 — The Request**\n- Request ID: DR-9002\n- Customer: CRM-2048 (Acme Manufacturing)\n- Product: NS-500 Industrial Controller\n- Requested discount: 18%\n- Date: 2026-09-23\n- Requestor: Sarah Chen (sarah.chen@northstar.example)\n- Basis: Contract pricing (Acme Master Supply Agreement)\n\n**Step 2 — The Customer**\n- CRM account: CRM-2048 (Acme Manufacturing, Strategic)\n- ERP customer: C-1001 (Acme Mfg. Holdings) — same customer, different system names\n\n**Step 3 — The Product**\n- SKU: NS-500 (NS-500 Industrial Controller, $250,000 list price)\n\n**Step 4 — Active Contract**\n- Master Supply Agreement (ACME-MFG-2025): effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31 ✓\n- Covers NS-500 ✓\n- Active on 2026-09-23 ✓\n\n**Step 5 — Pricing Exception**\n- **Active exception**: EXC-ACME-NS500-15 (Schedule B to ACME-MFG-2025)\n  - Product: NS-500 only\n  - **Maximum eligible discount: 15%**\n  - Effective: 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31\n  - Covers this product and date ✓\n\n**Critical finding**: The requested discount (18%) **exceeds the maximum** established in the active pricing exception (15%).\n\n**Step 6 — Policy in Force**\n- Pricing Policy 2026 (effective 2026-01-01 to 2026-12-31)\n- Approval Authority Matrix 2026\n\n**Step 7 — Requestor's Authority**\n- Sarah Chen: Enterprise Account Executive\n- Authority limit under 2026 policy: ≤10%\n- Requested discount (18%) exceeds requestor's limit ✓\n\n**Step 8 — Required Approver (if authority were the only issue)**\n- 18% falls in >10% and ≤20% band\n- Required role: VP Sales (Michael Torres)\n- But authority alone does not resolve this; see Step 9.\n\n**Step 9 — Decision**\n\nThe request cannot be approved. The discount (18%) **exceeds the customer's established commercial eligibility**, which is capped at 15% by pricing exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15. As the SOP states, escalation to a higher approver does not remedy an eligibility breach; new or amended terms are required. The previous discount for Acme on NS-500 (DR-8104, 2025-09-16) was for 15%, matching the contractual maximum.\n\n---\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"REJECT_OR_ESCALATE\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9002\",\n    \"customer\": \"CRM-2048 (Acme Manufacturing) / C-1001 (Acme Mfg. Holdings)\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-500\",\n    \"requested_discount\": \"18.0%\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"sarah.chen@northstar.example\",\n    \"basis\": \"contract_exception\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"exceeded\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": \"15.0%\",\n    \"basis\": \"EXC-ACME-NS500-15 (Pricing Exception, effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31, Schedule B to ACME-MFG-2025)\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"Pricing Policy 2026 / Approval Authority Matrix 2026\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": \"10.0%\",\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"VP Sales\",\n    \"approver\": \"Michael Torres (VP Sales) — but cannot approve due to eligibility breach, not authority issue\"\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"documents/acme_master_supply_agreement.md (active contract, effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31)\",\n    \"documents/acme_pricing_exception.md (EXC-ACME-NS500-15, maximum 15% on NS-500)\",\n    \"documents/pricing_policy_2026.md (Enterprise Account Executives ≤10%)\",\n    \"documents/approval_authority_matrix.md (VP Sales >10% and ≤20%)\",\n    \"documents/organization_chart.md (Sarah Chen is Enterprise Account Executive)\",\n    \"structured/crm_accounts.csv (CRM-2048 = Acme Manufacturing, Strategic)\",\n    \"structured/discount_requests.csv (DR-9002 and prior approval DR-8104 for 15% on same product, 2025-09-16)\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"what\": \"Pricing exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15 must be amended to support 18% discount, or new pricing exception must be created and approved, before this request can be approved. This requires commercial review by Deal Desk or Revenue leadership.\",\n      \"who\": \"Deal Desk / Chief Revenue Officer (David Morgan)\",\n      \"blocking\": true\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n**Next step**: Refer this request back to Sarah Chen or to Deal Desk with the finding that the 18% discount exceeds Acme's contractual maximum of 15%. If an 18% discount is commercially justified for this opportunity, the pricing exception must be amended or a new exception created and approved before the discount can be issued."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":25207,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":25207},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2eb4eb60-5ddd-41db-b328-cceeb1f6616a","uuid":"d80e1e88-abc2-45f6-84a0-052d1122feec","timestamp":"2026-10-08T11:15:28.419Z","request_id":"req_011CfpfzUMc4UnWghHbhiR7v"}
